{"id":"5d95b8963194821b","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration.md","title":"带底有向完备序上的超限迭代","display":"df-transfinite-monotone-iteration — 带底有向完备序上的超限迭代","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration","aliases":["72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration"],"display":"df-transfinite-monotone-iteration — 带底有向完备序上的超限迭代","depends_on":["[[72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §4.2, print759–760/PDF771–772; Ch.IX Definition3.3.1 print653/PDF665; explicit local set-sized construction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local well-definedness argument recorded","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22","revision_2026_10_22":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-transfinite-monotone-iteration — 带底有向完备序上的超限迭代"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3eb2e8e337f64cc\" href=\"?note=d3eb2e8e337f64cc\" title=\"72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order\">72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §4.2, print759–760/PDF771–772; Ch.IX Definition3.3.1 print653/PDF665; explicit local set-sized construction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local well-definedness argument recorded"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在ZFC中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)\">\\(\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Directed},\\operatorname{Sup}\">\\(\\operatorname{Directed},\\operatorname{Sup}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3eb2e8e337f64cc\" href=\"?note=d3eb2e8e337f64cc\" title=\"72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order\">72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:D\\to D\">\\(F:D\\to D\\)</span> 单调，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 为任意序数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的非空有向子集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 是唯一描述算子，仅在所示唯一对象存在时使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lim},\\mathfrak h,J^\\theta_{D,\\preceq,b,F}\">\\(\\operatorname{Lim},\\mathfrak h,J^\\theta_{D,\\preceq,b,F}\\)</span> 在下式引入；固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\preceq,b\">\\(D,\\preceq,b\\)</span> 时将最后一个记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_{F,\\theta}\">\\(J_{F,\\theta}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>序数及其有限、超限函数都是元理论集合；不把所有阶段组成一个集合参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow 0&lt;\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\lambda\\ (\\alpha+1&lt;\\lambda),\\\\\n\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}S&amp;:=\\iota z\\in D\\ \\operatorname{Sup}(z,S;D,\\preceq),\\\\\n\\mathfrak h(D)&amp;:=\\min\\{\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}:\\neg\\exists e\\in D^\\kappa\\ \\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\ (e(\\alpha)\\ne e(\\beta))\\},\\\\\nJ^\\theta_{D,\\preceq,b,F}&amp;:=\\iota J\\in D^{\\theta+1}\\ \\bigl[J(0)=b\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\theta\\ (J(\\alpha+1)=F(J(\\alpha)))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}\\land\\forall\\lambda\\le\\theta\\ (\\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Sup}(J(\\lambda),\\{J(\\alpha):\\alpha&lt;\\lambda\\};D,\\preceq))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow 0&lt;\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\lambda\\ (\\alpha+1&lt;\\lambda),\\\\\n\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}S&amp;:=\\iota z\\in D\\ \\operatorname{Sup}(z,S;D,\\preceq),\\\\\n\\mathfrak h(D)&amp;:=\\min\\{\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}:\\neg\\exists e\\in D^\\kappa\\ \\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\ (e(\\alpha)\\ne e(\\beta))\\},\\\\\nJ^\\theta_{D,\\preceq,b,F}&amp;:=\\iota J\\in D^{\\theta+1}\\ \\bigl[J(0)=b\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\theta\\ (J(\\alpha+1)=F(J(\\alpha)))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}\\land\\forall\\lambda\\le\\theta\\ (\\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Sup}(J(\\lambda),\\{J(\\alpha):\\alpha&lt;\\lambda\\};D,\\preceq))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Hartogs定理给不能单射入集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的序数；最小者因序数良序而唯一。也可从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 各子集上的良序关系构成的集合，经替换取其序型的严格上界得到。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 作超限递归：零阶段取底，后继取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>，非零极限的既有阶段递增，因而构成非空有向集，其上确界存在唯一。递增性与构造同时归纳：后继用单调性，极限时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(J(\\lambda))\">\\(F(J(\\lambda))\\)</span> 是先前阶段的上界，给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(\\lambda)\\preceq F(J(\\lambda))\">\\(J(\\lambda)\\preceq F(J(\\lambda))\\)</span>。故唯一描述有合法对象，未预设迭代函数已经存在。这里是原书超限迭代方法的集合大小版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order","status":"resolved","id":"d3eb2e8e337f64cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order","status":"resolved","id":"d3eb2e8e337f64cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在ZFC中，$\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)$，其中 $\\operatorname{Directed},\\operatorname{Sup}$ 取 [[72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order]]；$F:D\\to D$ 单调，$\\theta$ 为任意序数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Directed},\\operatorname{Sup}","display":false},{"tex":"F:D\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lim},\\mathfrak h,J^\\theta_{D,\\preceq,b,F}","display":false},{"tex":"D,\\preceq,b","display":false},{"tex":"J_{F,\\theta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)&:\\Longleftrightarrow 0<\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\lambda\\ (\\alpha+1<\\lambda),\\\\\n\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}S&:=\\iota z\\in D\\ \\operatorname{Sup}(z,S;D,\\preceq),\\\\\n\\mathfrak h(D)&:=\\min\\{\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}:\\neg\\exists e\\in D^\\kappa\\ \\forall\\alpha<\\beta<\\kappa\\ (e(\\alpha)\\ne e(\\beta))\\},\\\\\nJ^\\theta_{D,\\preceq,b,F}&:=\\iota J\\in D^{\\theta+1}\\ \\bigl[J(0)=b\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\theta\\ (J(\\alpha+1)=F(J(\\alpha)))\\\\\n&\\hspace{27mm}\\land\\forall\\lambda\\le\\theta\\ (\\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Sup}(J(\\lambda),\\{J(\\alpha):\\alpha<\\lambda\\};D,\\preceq))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"F(J(\\lambda))","display":false},{"tex":"J(\\lambda)\\preceq F(J(\\lambda))","display":false}],"bytes":2853,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-421","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration|df-transfinite-monotone-iteration — 带底有向完备序上的超限迭代]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-432","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]"},{"id":"585b074277aea3ae","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\theta$ 为序数；$J^\\theta_{K,\\sqsubseteq,U,\\mathcal E_P}$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]。$J_P^n$ 是 [[72-df-finite-envelope-iteration]] 的有限阶段，$n\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"6b5b4d9209f24056","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)$，$F:D\\to D$；$\\operatorname{Directed},\\operatorname{Sup},\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"超限单调迭代：[[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]"},{"id":"2a71248c57bfde0f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"序数采用von Neumann表示。$D,\\preceq,b,F,S$ 由下式给出；$J_{F,\\theta}$ 使用 [[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]] 在这个结构上的迭代。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-455","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration|df-transfinite-monotone-iteration — 带底有向完备序上的超限迭代]]"},{"id":"e85e168ce8db5c81","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D,\\preceq,b,F,\\theta$ 与 $J_{F,\\theta}$ 同 [[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]；$\\eta\\le\\theta$ 为序数，$z\\in D$。"},{"id":"1281b74b358815ce","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D,\\preceq,b,F$ 如 [[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]；$\\theta:=\\mathfrak h(D)$，$J:=J_{F,\\theta}$。$\\kappa_F,u_F$ 在下式给出；固定点与前不动点均在 $D$ 中。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-324","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]"}],"outgoing":["d3eb2e8e337f64cc"]}